UnitDynamicSwapFeeHook::BeforeFlash
├── when caller isn't pool
│   └── it reverts with CNP
└── when caller is pool
    ├── when base fee is ZERO_FEE_INDICATOR
    │   └── it returns 0
    ├── when base fee is zero
    │   └── it returns tick spacing fee
    └── when base fee is not zero
        └── it returns base fee
